{"success":true,"site":"tmdb","sid":"movie/10997","tmdb_id":10997,"title":"霸王别姬","original_title":"霸王别姬","overview":"在著名导演陈凯歌这部关于激情、命运与艺术超越性可能的恢弘史诗中，一段令人屏息的缱绻情缘于社会巨变的广阔背景下徐徐展开。影片横跨二十世纪五十载，追随着心怀梦想的京剧艺人程蝶衣与段小楼的人生轨迹——从经受严酷训练的童年，到最终成为京剧名角。蝶衣对小楼未果的痴恋，与时代政治浪潮的翻涌交织，将他们卷入充满嫉妒与背叛的个人悲剧之中，人生如戏，戏若人生。这部首部荣获戛纳电影节金棕榈奖的中国电影，是最高规格的史诗制作——从每一帧精美的画面到深沉的情感冲击，皆令人震撼。","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vOEkLofQ8N1OdbGs5L87m7Plpw2.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBiZN1epQTu3F8iFLBuMhc4TRzr.jpg","release_date":"1993-01-01","year":"1993","runtime":"171 minutes","tmdb_rating_average":7.9,"tmdb_votes":676,"tmdb_rating":"7.9 / 10 from 676 users","genres":["剧情"],"languages":["Mandarin"],"countries":["China","Hong Kong"],"production_companies":["Beijing Film Studio","China Film Co-Production","Tomson (Hong Kong) Films Co., Ltd."],"directors":[{"name":"陈凯歌","id":20640}],"producers":[{"name":"徐枫","id":130394}],"cast":[{"id":69637,"name":"张国荣","original_name":"張國榮","character":"Cheng Dieyi / Xiao Douzi","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/xdSUevukGCrayOdLd4Kd6YSJnKR.jpg"},{"id":65277,"name":"张丰毅","original_name":"张丰毅","character":"Duan Xiaolou / Xiao Shitou","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/l3PtQzEU84l7B9XA6SitAGIIJqH.jpg"},{"id":643,"name":"巩俐","original_name":"巩俐","character":"Juxian","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/m3q1rIEdZmOnUVC0MSo1FcIGvp9.jpg"},{"id":67765,"name":"吕齐","original_name":"吕齐","character":"Master Guan","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/7NDhGtNCzSCMGj8VCPxWN571Xdh.jpg"},{"id":109436,"name":"英达","original_name":"英达","character":"Manager","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/sVOdfDuj6DPYwAxtX0i2v3VRqE4.jpg"},{"id":76913,"name":"葛优","original_name":"葛优","character":"Master Yuan Shiqing","image":"https://media.themoviedb.org/t/p/w300_and_h450_bestv2/s0JXQhCmKUmtxiuI2rjH8hfE470.jpg"},{"id":1346210,"name":"雷汉","original_nam